window.products.push({"id":916380,"name":"8 PCs Healing Crystals Chakra Stone Reiki crystals and Crystal Therapy, Meditation","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617YVNVCo9L._AC_UL1000_.jpg","description":"Here is a small idea of what each stone means, what chakras they focus on. 1) Green Aventurine  Green aventurine healing properties provide soothing energy to facilitate emotional healing, as supported by aventurine crystal meaning. Balance and harmony are more easily attained while anger, irritation and nervousness are reduced or eliminated. 2) Pink: Rose Quartz  Healing with Rose Quartz. Rose Quartz is the stone of universal love. It restores trust and harmony in relationships, encouraging unconditional love. Rose Quartzpurifies and opens the heart at all levels to promote love, self-love, friendship, deep inner healing and feelings of peace. 3) Red: Red Jasper  A stone of physical strength and energy, Red Jasper stimulates gently and steadily, enhancing stamina and endurance, and increasing the amount of chi, or life force, in one's aura. It is a stone of health and passion, and brings the courage to face unpleasant tasks and to rectify unjust situations. 4) Brown: Tiger's Eye  A stone of protection, Tiger Eye may also bring good luck to the wearer. It has the power to focus the mind, promoting mental clarity, assisting us to resolve problems objectively and unclouded by emotions. Particularly useful for healing psychosomatic illnesses, dispelling fear and anxiety. 5) Purple: Amethyst  Amethyst has healing powers to help with physical ailments, emotional issues, and in Energy Healing and Chakra balancing. Amethyst crystal therapies are primarily associated with physical ailments of the nervous system, the curing of nightmares and insomnia, and balancing the crown chakra. 6) Black: Obsidian Obsidian is truth-enhancing. A strongly protective stone, it forms a shield against negativity. It blocks psychic attack and absorbs negative energies from the environment. Obsidian draws out mental stress and tension. 7) Blue: Lapis Lazuli Encourages self-awareness","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617YVNVCo9L._AC_UL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YL","source_asin":"B08B5S399W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-916380","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B5S399W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B5S399W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
