window.products.push({"id":916525,"name":"Non-Slip Kids Clothes Hangers Star (Set of 5) - kids clothing hangers - baby clothes hangers (Fushia)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kUPo+vByL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hang clothing neatly in your little one’s closet with this set of 5 baby hangers from Sheffield Home. These Non-Slip Baby Hangers have a small shape and a super slim design with a non-slip fabric coating that holds clothing in place and prevents even wide-neck garments from slipping off and landing on the closet floor. The small silver hanger hooks and the slim profile of the hanger itself makes it easy to maximize storage space inside a small child’s closet. The cut out design of the hanger provides a bottom rung for added storage and allows you to use one hanger to hang matching tops and pants for little boys or hang coordinating dresses and leggings for little girls. These adorable baby hangers come in a range of neutral and fashion colors that can make your child’s closet look as pretty as the nursery itself. They have a soft and luxurious feel that keeps clothing in place and gently rounded edges that prevent the shoulders of garments from getting those unsightly hanger marks. In comparison to traditional plastic hangers, the super slim shape allows you to store more hangers on a closet rod while the double rung design offers two layers of storage on each piece. As babies outgrow their tiniest garments, the bottom rung of the hanger can still be used to hold small toddler pants, shorts, or skirts. The next time you give a baby shower gift or send a sweet newborn a darling little outfit to wear when they get home from the hospital, toss the plastic hangers that baby clothes are often sold on and include a set of these convenient hangers instead. Giving a gift already placed on a hanger makes it easier for new moms and dads who have their hands full with diaper changes and feedings. These baby hangers can also be used to hang linens or keepsake blankets that mom and dad aren’t quite ready to part with. Non-Slip Kids Clothes Hangers Star (Set of 5) - kids clothing hangers - baby clothes hangers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kUPo+vByL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sheffield Home","source_asin":"B00IOSHDOG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-916525","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IOSHDOG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IOSHDOG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
