window.products.push({"id":916563,"name":"Soul & Lane Carterton Treasure Chest for Kids: Old-Fashioned Decorative Box with Hinged Lid, Vintage Keepsake Box with Metal Hardware, Antique Weather","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iCwfZvSNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A treasure chest box is an excellent way to keep your home organized. If you want to declutter your home, or if you want to make sure that everything is organized and tidy at all times, then you’ll want to invest in some wooden trunks. In fact, these wood storage boxes can be used as small treasure chest, time capsule box and steamer trunk, to name just a few ideas.  This handsome small chest adds character and charm to any space. Use our kids treasure chest individually for storage in an office, bedroom, or playroom. Or stack Soul & Lane decorative storage boxes and they make the ideal side table decorated with books, a small lamp, or a vintage tray. In addition to adding warmth and elegance to your home, these decorative wooden boxes are perfect for storing and organizing items of all sizes. Our chest box would be wonderful for holding seasonal items or for keeping board games, DVDs, or mobile cables hidden but easily accessible. Each kitchen storage box features a strong handle, stitched faux leather straps and vintage-style hardware.  This wooden chest is a great photography or display prop. Use this large treasure chest for a travel-themed photo shoot or wizard-inspired room décor to keep your youngster’s favorite books or other magic props! Order two or more Soul & Lane wood chests - one to keep and one to have on hand as a special gift. When friends and family members see these beautiful travel trunks, they’ll want to know where you got them. Surprise someone special with a set of their own.  There are so many different types of trunks with lock available that it’s easy to find the perfect one for you and your home. Our BOX is extremely durable. You can store just about anything in these trunks, and they won’t break down. They’re built to last, so you can use them for a long time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iCwfZvSNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Soul & Lane","source_asin":"B07JNTWGKL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-916563","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JNTWGKL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JNTWGKL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
