window.products.push({"id":916615,"name":"QUTOOL Cooling Pillows for Sleeping, Memory Foam Pillows 2 Pack, Bed Pillows Queen Size Set of 2 Gel Infused Adjustable Pillow with Bamboo & Cooling P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":63.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711jT9EbpsL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"🌙LET'S ENJOY A PAINLESS SLEEP! - Do you wake up every morning with pains in your neck? Filling with premium gel memory foam, QUTOOL memory foam pillow molds to your head and neck as lying down and helps body maintain the perfect head, neck, and spine alignment while they snooze. The cooling pillow can relieve neck and shoulder pain, create balance between supportive and firmness, provide good support and improve sleep quality. Whether you prefer soft or firm pillows, The pillow is just for you. 🌙Adjustable Loft and Firmness - Too hard, too firm, too soft, no support? QUTOOL adjustable pillow provides hotel-quality softness, and offers firm support. Unlike traditional down pillows, the shredded memory foam pillows features a zippered inner and outer cover, you can ADD or REMOVE foam filling to suit your size, shape or sleep position, find the perfect comfort level and provide you with the ultimate sleeping experience. Perfect for side sleepers, back sleepers and stomach sleepers. 🌙Innovative Cooling Technology - Are you tired of waking up sweaty? QUTOOL bed pillows king set of 2 is designed with double-sided cover for cooling&soft touch. The cooling side is made of cooling ice silky fabric, and the soft side is made of 40% bamboo rayon 60% polyester. So the bamboo side is built to keep your pillow in place, while the cooling side is ice cold and silky soft to the touch, reducing the heat your body produces during the night. 🌙RISKLESS & HIGH QUALTIY MEMORY FOAM - Certified with CertiPUR-US, QUTOOL bed pillows for sleeping is non-risk for your lovers or family. Unlike other bed pillows, we freshly manufacture our foam instead of using repurposed materials. This means all our side sleeper pillows are free from harmful substance, you can enjoy every peaceful night's sleep with QUTOOL cooling pillows for sleeping. 🌙NEVER FLAT -The slow-rebound feature made it support firmly with comfort and softness. And we use innovative memory foam technology to add durability, so you don't have to rearrange or flip pillows in the middle of the night and don't have to worry about them changing firm or density due to season. Further, open-cell gel memory foam and highly breathable pillowcases allow for ventilation and airflow throughout the cool pillow, which provides you with a cooling night. 🌙Inside-out Breathable King Pillow - Shredded memory foam allows air to circulate smoothly within the sleeping pillow, and the cooling pillow cover provides breathability and softness, so qutool pillow can maximize air circulation while you sleep. You can finally wake up refreshed. The cover is machine washable to keep your cooling pillows always fresh and new. 🌙WARM TIPS - No worries if it has a slight odor, it's normal with new foam. Allow it to air out for about 1 or 2 days. 🌙Ideal health Christmas gifts for Women and men- Measuring 20\" x 36\" in king size set of 2(Cut Size). Soft and support like hotel pillow. The bamboo pillow is appropriate for elderly, office workers, students and all ages people for deeper sleep. Good gift to show your care to somebody you concerned. Perfect Christmas gifts for dad or mom, birthday gift, Mother's Day gift, or Father's Day gift to friends and families. 🌙NO-WORRY PURCHASE& RESPONSIVE CUSTOMER SERVICE! - Finding a great cooling pillow that can help reduce your sleeping problems is an efficient way to improve your sleep each night. We are so confident about the quality of our pillows for side sleeper and offer a 1-year warranty and 30-day refund policy. If have any questions, feel free to call our service support team, we care about the shopping experience of every customer, and we will do all we can to provide you with a satisfying experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711jT9EbpsL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QUTOOL","source_asin":"B09ZLSSCBJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-916615","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZLSSCBJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZLSSCBJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
