window.products.push({"id":916627,"name":"115 Pcs Dried Preserved Eucalyptus Stems & Lavender Flowers Bundles for Shower, 17'' Natural Real Live Eucalyptus Leaves Hanging Lavender Shower Plant","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91++LBxMsiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💐Perfect Partner - With the soothing blend of eucalyptus and lavender, one can be transported to an environment of pure bliss and relaxation. The fresh inhales of eucalyptus supplemented by the calming exhale of lavender provides a sweet balance between the two. 🌱100% Natural Plants- Select high-quality eucalyptus and lavender. The package includes 15 stems preserved eucalyptus and1.8 oz ( about 100 pcs ) dried Lavender (measured and packaged by hand, please allow a slight difference in size and quantity) lengths 15''-17''. Unpacking, there will be some scattered Lavender seeds in it, which are particularly easy to fall off. This is also the characteristic of natural plants. The package gives you an organza bag, which can be collected to make sachets. 🌿Home Spa Experience - Our natural eucalyptus and lavender bundle is free of additives and retains the original fragrance of these plants. When the bundle is exposed to hot steam, it releases the essential oils of eucalyptus and lavender, creating a refreshing and relaxing aroma that can help restore your vitality, relieve stress, promote better sleep, and alleviate upper respiratory problems. 🌷Versatile Decoration -Eucalyptus and lavender are versatile decoration options for various settings. They are natural aromatherapy enhancers and can be used to create wall hangings, bedroom and bathroom decor,as well as for weddings and parties, adding warmth and comfort to any environment. 🎄Care Tips - The special preservation technology makes them look like fresh plants. If kept in a humid environment for a long time, green glycerin liquid may be separated, don't worry, that is non-toxic and harmless. Hung it between the shower head and the wall to prevent hot water from directly showering on the bundle, which can prolong the service time. Eucalyptus shower gives the stress relief and relaxation they need and deserve. Perfect gift for friends, family, mom and dad.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91++LBxMsiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oning","source_asin":"B0BY1MBP7Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-916627","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY1MBP7Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY1MBP7Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
