window.products.push({"id":916662,"name":"Arkwright UnBleached Cheesecloth for Straining - 100% Natural Cotton Grade 50 [Medium, Tight Weave] Extra Large 70 Yards, Cheese Cloth for Event Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dq8SbG0dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Arkwright LLC The brand provides you with the perfect Unbleached Weave Cheesecloth available in today’s market by researching, testing and designing products thoroughly. For centuries culinary artisans, designers, and woodworkers have relied on cheesecloth to bring their creations to life. From straining to staining, cheesecloth is versatile, inexpensive, and unique. Our cheesecloth is woven in a medical manufacturing facility to ensure product purity.  Arkwright Cheesecloth is made of 100% cotton. This unbleached muslin fabric is durable, washable and reusable. It's absorbent, making it ideal for making hung curd, soy milk, cottage cheese, straining stocks, canning, basting, stuffing poultry, keeping chicken or fish intact when poaching and more. Wrap a turkey or chicken when roasting. Squeeze the juice out of a lemon without letting the seeds fall into the juice. Or you can use it to wrap spices  This strong fabric can be washed and used again and again, which saves you money, and helps the environment too. When we talk about our grade cheesecloth, one of the things that stand out is the durability and lifespan of the cloth.  They come in the following size variations. Grades of cheesecloth reflect thread count. The higher the grade, the finer the weave. Grade 50 is a looser weave and Grade 90 feels almost like a fabric! These unbleached cheesecloths are off-white/natural in color. Grade 50 10 Boxes of 630 sq. ft. each (Total 700 sq. yards) Grade 60 10 Boxes of 540 sq. ft. each (Total 600 sq. yards) Grade 90 10 Boxes of 450 sq. ft. each (Total 500 sq. yards) Available in two put-ups 1. As a retail single box 2. As a bulk case of 10 boxes","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dq8SbG0dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arkwright LLC","source_asin":"B0BSMKQ7Q9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-916662","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSMKQ7Q9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSMKQ7Q9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
