window.products.push({"id":916886,"name":"ANVEVO Her King, His Queen - Two 6\" Handmade Rustic Couple Metal Wood Signs – Cute Rustic Wall Decor Art - Farmhouse Decorations – Couple Bathroom Sig","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814wfcaSCIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bedroom Artwork For Wall – Romantic Add a Touch of Funky Fun, Style and Personality to Your Home Channel your inner loving prankster & fill your home with laughter with these gorgeous signs which read ”Her King” and “His Queen\". Yes, it’s exactly what every living room is missing. Make home guests & loved ones giggle and feel the love 24/7. A Much-Needed Dose of LOVE & Light Humor! Our wooden plaques with quotes are funny - even the grumpiest person will crack a smile! They’re the cutest reminder to have a laugh for once in a while. Perfect to cheer up and lend a dash of designer appeal to any bedroom, powder room, farmhouse or workspace. Tastefully Designed From Genuine Wood & Metal Every sign is handcrafted to the highest quality standards in our workshop (Cadwell, GA) from natural wood and metal. Nothing else. Whatever the space, these signs will look ace! Nail Hooks Included for Multiple Display Options Get creative! Mount these versatile “buddies” on walls, doors, OR strategically place them on bedside tables or bathroom vanity shelves. Take your home decorating ideas to the next level! Perfectly Sized Measuring 6 x 3.5 x 1 inches, each piece of decorative wood wall décor fits into any space, corner or on desks without being overwhelming. Discreet. Simple. Elegant. Weatherproof We seal our wood with stain for long-lasting resistance in any weather. Add character to your garden, backyard, barn or country home! Makes a Thoughtful Novelty Gift Spread sheer joy! Browse our funny artwork accents for home to find a lighthearted, unusual gift for almost any occasion. Unique Happy Anniversary Parents or Anniversary Gifts For Him. Anvevo – A Bit Of Cheeky Humor Goes A Long Way! We’re here to get people smiling and add a modern feel to every home. Enjoy the most clever, funniest, super stylish YET affordable signs!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814wfcaSCIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANVEVO","source_asin":"B08BYWQH57","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-916886","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BYWQH57","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BYWQH57","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":916887,"name":"IMPRESA 2 Sets of Thermos Stainless King (TM) -Compatible 16 Ounce Travel Tumbler / Mug Gaskets / Seals Products - BPA-/Phthalate-/Latex-Free - 2 Full","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pP6qjdCsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Installation Tips: 1.) You will need a small, thin implement to change the gaskets, such as the rotating portion of a nail file or a flat head screwdriver for glasses repair.2.) You may want to soak the gaskets in hot water for a few minutes to loosen them up and make it easier to seat them. This may not be required - only necessary if you are having trouble seating them. Installation Instructions: 1.) Remove the lid and place it top down.2.) Rotate the innermost piece on the central rod to the left until it clicks out of place. Place it aside.3.) Remove the gasket that sat underneath that piece and discard it.4.) Remove the flat circular piece to expose the bottom of the lid.5.) Remove the innermost (smallest) gasket that sits around the central rod and discard it.6.) Replace the innermost (smallest gasket), using your implement to get it fully seated, if necessary.7.) Remove the outer gasket (largest gasket) and discard it.8.) Replace that outermost gasket, again using your implement to get it seated, if necessary.9.) Place the flat circular piece back over the central rod with the words facing up.10.) Replace the gasket over the central rod, ensuring that it is fully seated.11.) Place the small piece back over the central rod and twist it to the right to click it back into place. All Set! This is an aftermarket product manufactured by Impresa Products. Any other brands mentioned are for illustrative purposes only and are in no way affiliated with Impresa Products, nor do they endorse Impresa Products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pP6qjdCsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IMPRESA","source_asin":"B07BLJB726","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-916887","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BLJB726","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BLJB726","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
