window.products.push({"id":916942,"name":"Deco Window ¾ Inch Copper Curtain Rod for Windows and Doors adjustable curtain rod 36-66 Inch with Antique Copper Hexagon Finials and Brackets Set hea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VlpSChjJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STYLISH EXTENDABLE CURTAIN ROD: Deco Window presents extendable curtain rod that will surely add an attractive look to your interior space. With its adjustable curtain rod length up to 66\", it makes a perfect choice to hang curtains with eyelet hangings. Strong, sturdy & stylish, this curtain rod comes as a complete set with curtain pole, finials, brackets, screws, and fischers able Curtain / drapery rodsRod, it is telescopic and can be expanded or collapsed to fit a particular window size. ADJUSTABLE TELESCOPING ROD: The offered decorative curtain rods for windows 36 to 66 has an adjustable telescopic design that makes it to extend up to 66 inches in length from a minimalistic 36 inches, making it the perfect solution for standard, custom or lengthy curtains. It is recommended to install brackets wider than the window to minimize sidelight and enhance privacy. WHAT’S IN THE BOX: We offer entire solution for complete curtain rod installation including 1 X Extendable Curtain Pole 36\"-66\"), 2 X Finials, 3 X Brackets, 6 X Screws & Fischers. You don’t have to call a professional for its installation as it can be easily fixed on ceiling as well as wall; all thanks to its multipurpose brackets that just needs simple drilling for installation. ENHANCED STRENGTH: Designed in 1 Inch diameter, the offered curtain hanging rod is designed using premium quality iron metal and treated with brown oil for a more realistic designer appeal and finish. Besides, the designer finials are made by utilizing premium quality materials that not only uplift the charm of your interiors but also improves their longevity. DESIGNER END FINIALS: The offered curtain rod comes with a pair of designer finials to be installed at the edges of the curtain rods. These end caps are suitable for quick installation over the bar; giving your curtain rods a more attractive look. The offered rod is the best choice for light, medium or heavy weight curtains; all thanks to its 20kg load bearing capacity.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VlpSChjJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deco Window","source_asin":"B0BXDHM5HL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-916942","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXDHM5HL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXDHM5HL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":916943,"name":"BGment Color Block Sheer Curtains for Living Room - Faux Linen Grommet Light Filtering Semi Sheer Window Curtain Panels for Bedroom, Set of 2 Panels (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fmv4Lx6FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ready Made: 2 panels color block sheer curtains each package. Each panel measures 52 inches wide by 95 inches long, the combined width is 104 inches. With 8 silver metal grommets on top, fit well to 1.5 inches diameter curtain rod. Unique Design: BGment color block semi sheer curtains can make your room more elegant and stunning, with the vibrant color on the top matching soft white on the bottom. The window curtains are semi-transparency which will create a breezy refreshing look and the natural light will exposure to your favorite room. Light Filtering: Linen texture sheer window curtains filter nature light to flow through your windows, brightening up rooms and giving you a soft airy feel, matching with any home interior style. These room curtains can avoid light glaring through the window and protect your personal privacy from outside bother. Elegant and Decorative: BGment color block sheer curtain panels not only can brighten your room but also bring personality to your home. The light and transparent sheer curtains can greatly reduce the visual depression and dance with the wind on a windy day, allowing home to penetrate more sunlight and natural scenery. Easy Care: These durable sheer are tear resistant, winkle free and shrink resistant. Simply use machine wash with cold water, gentle cycle, tumble dry on low heat. Do not bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fmv4Lx6FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BGment","source_asin":"B08GFXWY7H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-916943","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GFXWY7H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GFXWY7H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
